Each person should choose either red or blue. If they all agree to press the same button, say red, then the majority will always be red, ensuring everyone survives. Similarly, if they all choose blue, it ensures everyone dies because blue is the majority when N > 1. However, choosing a single color guarantees that no one has a chance of switching and causing others to die. Therefore, the optimal strategy for each person is to press one button.

